{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《東張西望》今集繼續跟進無辜貓咪妮妮於絕育手術中不幸慘死，引爆獸醫診所涉嫌由護士操刀割錯膀胱引發震撼全城醫療事 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《東張西望》今集繼續跟進無辜貓咪妮妮於絕育手術中不幸慘死，引爆獸醫診所涉嫌由護士操刀割錯膀胱引發震撼全城醫療事故。毫無話事權兼且拒絕簽署保密協議要求退股投資者周生，決定向外界公開極度混亂內部帳目。連串涉嫌無牌行醫指控與絕密錄音終於令負責人出面和盤托出駭人內幕。</p>\n<h2>貓咪妮妮閹割慘死揭涉嫌無牌行醫黑幕</h2>\n<p>受害貓咪妮妮早前進行絕育手術期間懷疑慘遭護士切錯膀胱枉死，事件迅速被寵物界同行揭發惹起全城公憤。有曾與涉事護士Polly共事過獸醫向節目組勇敢指證，直指對方過去已多次要求親自落手處理貓隻絕育手術，更曾目擊她親自替另一員工Chloe愛貓開刀。妮妮主人許生原本於網上發文求助，帖文卻在短時間內離奇消失，就連曾經協助轉發帖文寵物同行亦相繼收到律師信警告，要求全數刪除相關醫療事故指控並交還關鍵證據。</p>\n<h2>診所負責人Antony受訪承認管理疏忽致歉</h2>\n<p>面對排山倒海指控，寵物診所負責人Antony親自現身解畫並對外鄭重道歉。他堅稱今年1月試業至今一直由註冊獸醫應診，強調Polly僅負責介紹工作及供應儀器，並已於今年2月正式離職完全退股。對於Polly為何在5月依然代表診所接受傳媒訪問講述深奧醫療問題，Antony解釋當時對方聲稱有能力回答才答允安排。他承認自己輕易相信古靈精怪班底屬嚴重過失，現時已解僱包括Chloe在內所有涉案同黨，並自責「對事件責無旁貸」。</p>\n<h2>投資者周生狂擲過百萬首度公開驚人錄音</h2>\n<p>整場風波之所以越鬧越大，全因苦主周生經Chloe介紹結識Polly並合資開設獸醫診所。周生合共支付120萬後卻發現自己毫無決策權，投資足足23個月依然從未見過任何清晰帳目。當他驚覺不妥要求退出時，Polly竟要求簽署嚴苛保密協議書禁止對外聯絡及公開資訊。周生果斷拒絕就範並將內部錄音全數曝光，大律師陸偉雄更以專業角度公開建議妮妮主人針對涉案人士疑似冒充獸醫身分報警求助，力證欺詐罪屬公訴程序而不受6個月檢控時限約束。</p>\n<h2>網民群起聲討促警方介入調查</h2>\n<p>涉嫌無牌行醫風波隨即在各大網上討論區引發熱議，大批觀眾對小生命無辜喪生感到極度遺憾。不少網民狠批診所集團式經營手法猶如詐騙，紛紛留言「一定要重新報警，告個班騙子！」及「希望政府加強監管！」。對於負責人Antony聲稱不知情說法，大量網民表示難以置信，直斥「呢條友真係唔知？鬼信你」及「你唔話比佢知有訪問佢點知有訪問呀」，更有人引用《獸醫註冊條例》指出假冒獸醫必定屬刑事罪行，強烈呼籲更多潛在受害者企出來指證無良商人。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570652024725477_1318947576b084e995086b.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 無牌行醫 妮妮疑因絕育手術中被護士切錯膀胱慘死。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570652024725477_1318947576b084e995086b.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>妮妮疑因絕育手術中被護士切錯膀胱慘死。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570652800035545_20220971326b084ea0a16cb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 無牌行醫 告密者周生受訪講述曝光絕密錄音因由，他哭訴妮妮死得很慘！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570652800035545_20220971326b084ea0a16cb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>告密者周生受訪講述曝光絕密錄音因由，他哭訴妮妮死得很慘！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570653499385940_7032880286b084ea7747fd.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 無牌行醫 周生 經Chloe認識Polly並夾錢投資開獸醫診所。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570653499385940_7032880286b084ea7747fd.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>周生 經Chloe認識Polly並夾錢投資開獸醫診所。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570654317224282_7754332016b084eaf9596c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 無牌行醫 陸大狀建議妮妮主人再去報警調查Polly是否涉欺詐罪。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570654317224282_7754332016b084eaf9596c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陸大狀建議妮妮主人再去報警調查Polly是否涉欺詐罪。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570655001054354_2601651856b084eb6d3f90.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 無牌行醫 有網民揭Polly有入手術室工作。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570655001054354_2601651856b084eb6d3f90.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有網民揭Polly有入手術室工作。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570655438424750_2885958936b084ebad7b4d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 無牌行醫 苦主的帖文疑被診所討論群組滅聲。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179570655438424750_2885958936b084ebad7b4d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>苦主的帖文疑被診所討論群組滅聲。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957065597841909_2092724766b084ec09e1d5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 無牌行醫 寵物診所負責人Antony表示Polly涉及嚴重罪行。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957065597841909_2092724766b084ec09e1d5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>寵物診所負責人Antony表示Polly涉及嚴重罪行。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張西望</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%84%a1%e7%89%8c%e8%a1%8c%e9%86%ab/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">無牌行醫</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%86%ab%e7%99%82%e4%ba%8b%e6%95%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">醫療事故</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3550796\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:24:17.802765+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1643,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:22:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T01:17:37.754048+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:17:49.281672+00:00","content_hash":"3c9fce183d279d5efe1fb2962bf3d3393ee1e17bd8ff5474f9fa6a427ad1da8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}